OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 FEB
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GFiona Talkington introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including Berlioz's
OL,8,     GHarold in Italy symphony and
OL,9,     Grecent studio recordings by Radio
OL,10,     G3's New Generaton Artists.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Amy Beach
OL,12,     GDonald explores the story behind
OL,13,     Gthe 'first Symphony by an
OL,14,     GAmerican woman' - Amy Beach's
OL,15,     G'Gaelic' Symphony of 1897.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GTim Garland and Geoffrey Keezer
OL,18,     Gplay live and Katie chats to
OL,19,     Gconductor Kevin John Edusei.
OL,20,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,21,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,22,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
